{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:13 2026-09-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:13 2026-09-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:13 2026-09-06 HKT</p><p>蔡約翰馬房向來予人慢熱之感，可是今日開鑼日賽事，馬房卻發動攻勢，並且在第六場四班千二米憑「辣得準」贏得今季在港首場頭馬，而該駒鞍上人艾兆禮，亦成為今日潘頓之後，第二位起孖的騎師。</p><p>賽後「辣得準」馬主吳創木說：「『辣得準』上季也是在開鑼日報捷，今場季內初出，順利取勝，美夢重溫，十分開心。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c7a852d4c8be80b2605124dbec9a3c9a/2026-09/0d5b75c4-5590-47e6-a57b-bb6fdc7065cf.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a23a8172adb5afcc28c85911f9456bd9/2026-09/1b8fd21d-7963-4b3c-8722-c06efbc99e4e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aeee21a2c2aad8485dc3cb6f92423bbd/2026-09/39da7f77-6a7a-4a6a-9877-b2b70d8dea22.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7d27ec3e1331ba49f511f6bd8d58b2c5/2026-09/55fd1930-6696-4baf-adf2-d9e194a41d23.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ab558a8ed7249106b7913abf71b36ab4/2026-09/b2d12bf7-1632-4d37-812b-6c17c9823d9b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c06ebc12cfefffe71b0deeee624767b8/2026-09/c13f0be1-006e-4f71-9207-af7948e3c090.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fffa3c12274ebfbfc14be2aac6540463/2026-09/d824f227-e45e-4c62-919f-b0a57426bd9b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d4070b3d4f00ad8134e1a64e05a39809/2026-09/ed774314-c2b6-431f-9236-65477731a94b.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T08:19:04.314144+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}